{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261119/photo/bkn-20261119081701809-1119_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261119083215\"/><p>香港大學站有信號設備故障。</p><p>港鐵於今晨(19日)8時17分表示，由於香港大學站附近有信號設備故障，列車行經該路段需要慢駛，整體行車時間（總站至總站）預計需要額外5至8分鐘。港鐵人員正在處理。請乘客為行程預留充裕時間。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T00:43:54.842512+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T00:17:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T00:37:30.617423+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T00:37:30.617423+00:00","content_hash":"b9b0c29723f1b620dbe52f2501333dd7a47eeb56cb78f8046112de239493ac2f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}